# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. Free key: https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
# The key ends up inside the app bundle, so treat it as public: in the MapTiler dashboard restrict it
# to the app's origin. MapTiler wants a bare domain: `localhost` (the app runs at
# https://localhost on the phone). The web demo doesn't use this key: it has a keyless map (#165).
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=
